  <h1>How I think about email</h1>
  <p>I've spent over 20 years helping businesses get real results from email. Here's a selection of resources, interviews, and content that explain how I think and work.</p>

  <h2>Masterclass</h2>
  <p>Watch my <a href="https://youtu.be/Xjrn4iKYeXk?si=LRGlhRCLOJmwqfAl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Mailchimp Masterclass on YouTube</a>. Most businesses think marketing requires a big budget. It doesn't.</p>
  <p>In this 54-minute masterclass, watched over 18,000 times, I walk through five practical, low-cost tactics you can put to work straight away. From running competitions and personalising your emails, to winning back lost customers, setting up automation, and making every touchpoint count.</p>
  <p>Whether you're just getting started or want to get more from what you already have, this is a good place to begin.</p>

